              "relationship_id": "spell.blood-biography:uses_definition:monster-type.undead"
            },
            {
              "node_type": "text",
              "value": " creatures are entitled to a saving throw to resist the spell. You can cast the spell on dried or fresh blood. Once you cast the spell the answers to the following four questions appear on any flat surface you designate (a wall, a piece of paper, and so on). "
